.TH LIBMPQ__ARCHIVE_VERSION 3 2026-08-12 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__archive_version \- return the MPQ archive format version.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B
#include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.sp
.BI "int32_t libmpq__archive_version("
.BI "        mpq_archive_s  *" "mpq_archive",
.BI "        uint32_t       *" "version"
.BI ");"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Call \fBlibmpq__archive_version\fP() to get the archive format version.
Version 1 supports archives up to 2 GiB, and version 2 supports larger
archives.
.LP
The first argument is an archive handle opened by
\fBlibmpq__archive_open\fP(). The function stores the format version in
\fIversion\fP.
.SH RETURN VALUE
On success, a zero is returned.
